{"schema_version":1,"id":"018f0000-0000-7000-8000-00000000ca27","stream":{"kind":"session","id":"01a0b3fc-2962-7bc0-91c2-787ae4899fa1"},"sequence":878,"recorded_at":1780531400001751,"record_type":"event","durability":"durable","causation_id":"6cf4561a-8326-47da-a916-4850b6a43e2a","payload_type":"task.lifecycle.output","payload_schema_version":1,"payload":{"kind":"task_lifecycle","command_id":"6cf4561a-8326-47da-a916-4850b6a43e2a","run_stream":{"kind":"run","id":"6cf4561a-8326-47da-a916-4850b6a43e2a"},"task_stream":{"kind":"task","id":"01a0b3ff-a28a-75d3-a011-86ea10b3aff3"},"task_id":"01a0b3ff-a28a-75d3-a011-86ea10b3aff3","event":{"kind":"output","task_id":"01a0b3ff-a28a-75d3-a011-86ea10b3aff3","chunk":"Read text file `internal/termbind/TRACEABILITY.md`.\n1|# TRACEABILITY — internal/termbind (AX v0.7.0)\n2|\n3|Normative scope: AX v0.7.0 Section 4.B (Terminal Instance Binding 1.0.0\n4|closed object and the identity rule), Section 5.2 Session Event 4.0.0\n5|Terminal Instance events (terminal.created and session.resumed v4\n6|payloads), Section 4.D (evidence binding), Section 7.A (Provider\n7|Protocol 3 descriptor identity, cited landed), and Section 13.1\n8|(bootstrap idempotency and lost-result recovery). Story:\n9|ax-pane-and-terminal-instance-binding (final leaf).\n10|\n11|Rule: every row names its production entry point. A row is driven only\n12|when the named committed test executes that entry. Prose in place of\n13|the ratio is not evidence. 60 of 60 AC rows driven.\n14|\n15|## Identity and the Binding object (Section 4.B, Section 7.A)\n16|\n17|| # | Clause | Call site | Test |\n18||---|--------|-----------|------|\n19|| 1 | UUIDv7 admitted as terminal instance identity | CheckInstanceIdentity (identity.go) | TestCheckInstanceIdentityAdmitsUUIDv7 |\n20|| 2 | Eight forbidden forms (PID, handle, socket, path, pipe, URL, token, endpoint) refuse terminal_backend_protocol_error | CheckInstanceIdentity (identity.go) | TestCheckInstanceIdentityRefusesForbiddenForms (8 subtests) |\n21|| 3 | Closed Binding fixture admitted with literal members | ParseTerminalBinding (identity.go) | TestParseTerminalBindingAdmitsClosedFixture |\n22|| 4 | Eight forbidden forms in terminal_instance_id refuse the pinned code | ParseTerminalBinding (identity.go) | TestParseTerminalBindingRefusesForbiddenIdentity (8 subtests) |\n23|| 5 | Binding closed shape (missing/extra/duplicate member, wrong schema) refuses | ParseTerminalBinding (identity.go) | TestParseTerminalBindingClosedShape (4 subtests) |\n24|| 6 | Binding backend_generation 256 admits, 0 and 257 refuse | ParseTerminalBinding (identity.go) | TestParseTerminalBindingClosedShape/generation_bounds |\n25|| 7 | Binding native_reference 512 admits, 0 and 513 refuse | ParseTerminalBinding (identity.go) | TestParseTerminalBindingClosedShape/native_reference_bounds |\n26|| 8 | Tampered member and wrong self ID refuse terminal_backend_manifest_probe_mismatch | ParseTerminalBinding (identity.go) | TestParseTerminalBindingClosedShape (tampered, wrong_self_id) |\n27|| 9 | Binding identity construction agrees with the landed manifest admission | bindingIdentity via ParseManifest (identity.go) | TestBindingIdentityAgreesWithLandedAdmission |\n28|| 10 | Eight forbidden forms in the Provider Protocol 3 descriptor refuse the pinned code | AdmitProviderDescriptor, adopted landed (terminalbackend/descriptor.go) | TestAdmitDescriptorRefusesForbiddenIdentity (8 subtests) |\n29|| 11 | Eight forbidden forms in the mutation context refuse the pinned code | AdmitMutationContext (identity.go) | TestAdmitMutationContextRefusesForbiddenIdentity (8 subtests) |\n30|| 12 | Eight forbidden forms in the status body refuse the pinned code; null instance admitted | AdmitStatusBody (identity.go) | TestAdmitStatusBodyRefusesForbiddenIdentity (8 subtests + null) |\n31|| 13 | Non-string identity members delegate to the landed shape authority | AdmitMutationContext, AdmitStatusBody (identity.go) | TestAdmitSurfacesDelegateShapeFaults (2 subtests) |\n32|| 14 | Eight forbidden forms in the bootstrap binding refuse and persist nothing | Store.Bind, adopted (axpane/binding.go) | TestBootstrapBindingRefusesForbiddenIdentity (8 subtests) |\n33|| 15 | CLI Result 4.0.0 identity surface is a stated bound pinned by a tripwire | VersionForCommand, cited (cliresult) | TestCLIResult4IdentityIsUnimplementedBound |\n34|\n35|## Evidence resolution (Section 4.D, Section 5.2)\n36|\n37|| # | Clause | Call site | Test |\n38||---|--------|-----------|------|\n39|| 16 | Coherent universe resolves to manifest, probe, evidence, and admission | ResolveEvidence (resolve.go) | TestResolveEvidenceAdmitsUniverse |\n40|| 17 | Empty and 257-element evidence sets refuse the 1..256 bound | ResolveEvidence (resolve.go) | TestResolveEvidenceShapeBounds (empty, 257) |\n41|| 18 | Unsorted, duplicate, and non-digest evidence sets refuse | ResolveEvidence (resolve.go) | TestResolveEvidenceShapeBounds (unsorted, duplicate, non-digest) |\n42|| 19 | One digest passes the shape and refuses at the manifest/probe partition | ResolveEvidence (resolve.go) | TestResolveEvidenceShapeBounds/one_passes_shape_to_partition |\n43|| 20 | 256 digests pass the shape and refuse at lookup | ResolveEvidence (resolve.go) | TestResolveEvidenceShapeBounds/256_passes_shape_to_lookup |\n44|| 21 | Eleven foreign resolution targets refuse the mismatch class | ResolveEvidence (resolve.go) | TestResolveEvidenceRefusesForeignKinds (11 subtests) |\n45|| 22 | Missing or doubled manifest/probe refuses the stated cardinality | ResolveEvidence (resolve.go) | TestResolveEvidenceRequiresManifestAndProbe (4 subtests) |\n46|| 23 | Foreign-backend and protocol-drift evidence refuse at this gate | ResolveEvidence (resolve.go) | TestResolveEvidenceBindsEventTuple (2 subtests) |\n47|| 24 | Document substitution under another ID refuses | ResolveEvidence (resolve.go) | TestResolveEvidenceRejectsSubstitution (2 subtests) |\n48|| 25 | Admission faults (unevidenced claim, forged signature, expiry, registry drift) surface landed | ResolveEvidence via Registry.AdmitProbe (resolve.go) | TestResolveEvidenceDrivesLandedAdmission (4 subtests) |\n49|| 26 | Resolved objects carry no live-process fact | ResolveEvidence (resolve.go) | TestResolvedObjectsCarryNoLiveFacts |\n50|\n51|## Emission (Section 5.2)\n52|\n53|| # | Clause | Call site | Test |\n54||---|--------|-----------|------|\n55|| 27 | terminal.created v4 round-trips through the append path | EmitTerminalCreated (emit.go) | TestEmitTerminalCreatedRoundTrip |\n56|| 28 | session.resumed v4 round-trips (null and carried source); bad profile refuses | EmitResumed (emit.go) | TestEmitResumedRoundTrip (3 subtests) |\n57|| 29 | Unsorted and empty evidence refuse at the emission entries | EmitTerminalCreated (emit.go) | TestEmitClosedShapeRefusals (unsorted, empty) |\n58|| 30 | Missing/extra payload members refuse at the canonical boundary | Emit, adopted (axpane/events.go) | TestEmitClosedShapeRefusals (3 append subtests) |\n59|| 31 | Unresolvable and foreign evidence refuse inside both emission entries | EmitTerminalCreated, EmitResumed (emit.go) | TestEmitResolvesEvidence (3 subtests) |\n60|| 32 | Losing lease refuses and appends nothing | EmitTerminalCreated via Emit (emit.go) | TestEmitUnderLosingLeaseRefuses |\n61|| 33 | Byte-identical retry replays the one event | EmitTerminalCreated (emit.go) | TestEmitAppendsIdempotently |\n62|| 34 | Emitted bytes carry the opaque digest and no binding secret | EmitTerminalCreated (emit.go) | TestEmittedEventCarriesNoBindingObject |\n63|\n64|## Recovery (Section 13.1)\n65|\n66|| # | Clause | Call site | Test |\n67||---|--------|-----------|------|\n68|| 35 | No binding plus proven absence yields absence with replay_same | RecoverCreate (recover.go) | TestRecoverCreateProvesAbsence |\n69|| 36 | Binding plus matching live status yields the ONE child | RecoverCreate (recover.go) | TestRecoverCreateIdentifiesOneChild (2 subtests) |\n70|| 37 | Duplicate retry yields the identical verdict | RecoverCreate (recover.go) | TestRecoverCreateDuplicateRetrySameVerdict |\n71|| 38 | Changed operation in the fold-derived open window refuses idempotency_mismatch | RecoverCreate (recover.go) | TestRecoverCreateChangedOperationInWindowRefuses |\n72|| 39 | Changed operation in the fold-derived closed window proceeds | RecoverCreate (recover.go) | TestRecoverCreateChangedOperationPostWindowProceeds |\n73|| 40 | Lost create result recovers the ONE recorded child | RecoverCreate (recover.go) | TestRecoverCreateLostResult |\n74|| 41 | Five unprovable shapes yield unavailable with status_first, never absence | RecoverCreate (recover.go) | TestRecoverCreateNeverClaimsAbsent (5 subtests) |\n75|| 42 | Recorded child with a backend-absent observation replays the same pair | RecoverCreate (recover.go) | TestRecoverCreateRecordedChildBackendAbsentReplays |\n76|| 43 | Status read failure is an error, never absence | RecoverCreate (recover.go) | TestRecoverCreateUnknownIsNotAbsent |\n77|\n78|## Attach receipts (Section 4.C attach, Section 4.E)\n79|\n80|| # | Clause | Call site | Test |\n81||---|--------|-----------|------|\n82|| 44 | Attach records and replays one receipt per client pair | AttachStore.Attach/Lookup (attach.go) | TestAttachRoundTrip |\n83|| 45 | Identical retry replays the recorded receipt | AttachStore.Attach (attach.go) | TestAttachIdenticalRetryReplays |\n84|| 46 | Second client records alongside, never over | AttachStore.Attach (attach.go) | TestAttachSecondClientRecordsAlongside |\n85|| 47 | Transport/input conflict refuses idempotency_mismatch | AttachStore.Attach (attach.go) | TestAttachConflictRefusesMismatch |\n86|| 48 | Sixteen forbidden identity values refuse the pinned code | AttachStore.Attach (attach.go) | TestAttachRefusesForbiddenIdentity (16 subtests) |\n87|| 49 | Unknown transport refuses; relay refuses by landed policy | AttachStore.Attach (attach.go) | TestAttachTransportVocabulary (2 subtests) |\n88|| 50 | Expired, mismatched, and malformed policy refuses on every call | AttachStore.Attach (attach.go) | TestAttachRequiresLiveAuth (4 subtests) |\n89|| 51 | Attach emits neither event nor lease/fencing change | AttachStore.Attach (attach.go) | TestAttachEmitsNeitherEventNorStateChange |\n90|| 52 | Torn receipt is an error, never absence | AttachStore.Attach/Lookup (attach.go) | TestAttachUnknownIsNotAbsent |\n91|| 53 | Foreign-session lookup refuses | AttachStore.Lookup (attach.go) | TestAttachSessionMismatchRefuses |\n92|\n93|## Version skew and authority (Section 5.2)\n94|\n95|| # | Clause | Call site | Test |\n96||---|--------|-----------|------|\n97|| 54 | Takeover selects an admitted backend with a new digest and event, append-only, no fork | EmitTerminalCreated, EmitResumed (emit.go) | TestTakeoverSelectsNewBackendNewEvent |\n98|| 55 | v1 and v4 terminal events derive exactly their own surface | Reduce, adopted (sessstate) | TestVersionSelectionBothDirections (3 subtests) |\n99|| 56 | v4 retained verbatim, no lower-version replacement, query reads derive nothing new | GetEvent/ListEvents, Reader.List, adopted (sessrepo, sessquery) | TestV4RetainedAsImmutableHistory |\n100|| 57 | v4 carries no v1 derivation member: a v1 reader stays inert | DecodeEvent, adopted (sessstate) | TestV1ReaderSeesV4AsInert |\n101|\n102|## Crash and idempotency seams\n103|\n104|| # | Clause | Call site | Test |\n105||---|--------|-----------|------|\n106|| 58 | SIGKILL after the receipt commit leaves the complete receipt; retry replays | AttachStore.Attach (attach.go) | TestAttachCrashChildSelfTerminates (unix) |\n107|| 59 | SIGKILL between effect and result recovers the ONE child | RecoverCreate (recover.go) | TestRecoverCreateAfterKillRecoversChild (unix) |\n108|| 60 | Before-write abort leaves no event; after-commit keeps and replays | EmitTerminalCreated (emit.go) | TestEmitAppendHookSeams (2 subtests) |\n109|\n110|## Mutant table (30 rows: 28 narrowing + 1 supplementary arm-delete + 1 cont